# Infra rules

## Overview
- UI: S3 + Cloudflare (`infra/terraform/envs/web`)
- API Gateway: **Kong OSS** on EC2 (`infra/terraform/modules/data_plane`) — no nginx
- API domain: `api.get1agent.com` → Cloudflare A record → Kong proxy :80
- Kong UI: `kong.get1agent.com` → Kong Manager OSS (basic-auth protected)
- RDS PostgreSQL: databases `get1agent` (app/lambdas) + `kong` (Kong config)
- Kong → DB: **IAM auth** (user `kong_app`). DBeaver → SSM tunnel (`infra/aws/db-tunnel.sh`).

## Deploy scripts
- `infra/aws/deploy-all.sh` — infra + Kong
- `infra/aws/deploy-infra.sh` — Terraform only
- `infra/aws/deploy-kong.sh` — sync scripts + restart Kong on EC2 via SSM
- `infra/aws/kong-admin-creds.sh` — Kong Manager UI password
- `infra/aws/db-tunnel.sh` — SSM port forward to RDS for DBeaver

Full guide: **`infra/DEPLOY.md`**

## GitHub secrets
- `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID`, `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`
